    "created_at": "2026-08-10T15:59:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-10T15:59:22Z",
    "body": "This feature seems to apply to all cookies, not just the Cookie Store API. It probably makes sense to update the spec in one place where the cookie storage model is invoked.\r\n\r\n@annevk I think this type of thing belongs in Fetch when we move more of the cookie spec into that. The flag in this feature would be a side effect of Cookie Store API calling methods in the Fetch spec, since I do not see a reason this API needs to be aware of this flag. WDYT?",
