    "created_at": "2026-08-23T07:34:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-23T07:34:25Z",
    "body": "I think it's just cookie APIs (so this and `document.cookie`) that can cause this flag to be set. Not anything network-based. If that's correct having it here might be okay, though perhaps we should still have an abstraction that all APIs can use that takes care of this.",
