    "updated_at": "2026-09-29T04:46:57Z",
    "body": "I'm sorry for the long delay. I now have updated the PR to invoke the new `mark navigation conditions as potentially changed` abstract operation defined in whatwg/html#11765. This removes the need for the Cookie Store API to manually inspect the Window and Document navigable flags. Could you take another look?",
